  Arguments: (int canBeNone = 0), (int offset = 0)
  Returns: int
  Description: Returns 'indexGlobal' of the first selected channel When there is no selection, function will return -1 (or 0 if canBeNone is 1) Use optional 'offset' parameter to find other selected channels
