  Arguments: int index, (bool useGlobalIndex* = False)
  Returns: int
  Description: Returns eventID for channel at "index". Use this eventID in processRECEvent . Example (to get eventId for volume of first channel): eventId = midi.REC_Chan_Vol + channels.getRecEventId(0)
  API version: 1

